{
 "slug": "test/notification",
 "about": "A device change and the settle after it: the engine restarts on the new device, detection stands down and New Tap greys out (the view is told), a live chart is blanked, and the status says the device is reinitializing; once 3 s of AUDIO have passed since the LAST change and the next FFT frame has arrived, the level latch is re-anchored from that frame, readiness and listening come back, and the status is put back. Also the status overrides the settle has to see through. Each case starts a fresh analyzer (threshold −40, Taps 1) and runs the shared steps of tooling/analyzer-steps (settings, setTaps, newTap, pause, guitarTap, materialTap, accept, advance, routeChange — the engine restarted on a device change — and spectrumFrame — one FFT frame from the running engine, a spectrum as peaks.json describes one), plus {\"note\": true} (remembers the status and the peaks), {\"watchNotifications\": true} (readiness notifications are watched from here), {\"clipping\": bool}, {\"inputDead\": bool}, {\"couldNotRestart\": bool} (the engine's recovery gave up after failed restarts), {\"permissionDenied\": bool} (the engine reports the microphone permission refused), {\"couldNotStart\": bool} (the engine reports a start failed for anything but the permission) and {\"check\": {...}}. Fields: 'ready' (New Tap's readiness), 'readinessNotified' (the view was told of a readiness change since watchNotifications: Swift's objectWillChange, Python's readyForDetectionChanged, the web's subscribers), 'settling' (the chart is blanked), 'statusMessage' (exact), 'statusAsNoted', 'statusBeforeSettleAsNoted', 'statusIsArmedPrompt', 'statusIsMicrophoneAccessWarning' (the status is the edition's microphone-access warning — the natives say to restart GuitarTap, the web to reload the page), 'detecting', 'paused', 'complete', 'phase' (Swift's raw value), 'aboveThreshold' (the level latch), 'hasPeaks', 'peaksAsNoted'. Expected values are Swift's.",
 "cases": [
  {
   "id": "N1",
   "note": "a device change stands readiness down — New Tap greys out — and the view is told",
   "steps": [
    {
     "newTap": true
    },
    {
     "watchNotifications": true
    },
    {
     "routeChange": true
    }
   ],
   "expect": {
    "ready": false,
    "readinessNotified": true,
    "detecting": false,
    "statusMessage": "Audio device changed - reinitializing..."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "N2",
   "note": "the settle's end restores readiness and the view is told: 3 s of audio after the change, then the next frame",
   "steps": [
    {
     "newTap": true
    },
    {
     "routeChange": true
    },
    {
     "advance": 3.0
    },
    {
     "watchNotifications": true
    },
    {
     "spectrumFrame": {
      "kind": "gaussians",
      "binCount": 601,
      "binSpacingHz": 1,
      "noiseFloor": -100,
      "peaks": [
       {
        "peakHz": 150,
        "peakDB": -20,
        "halfWidthHz": 7
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ],
   "expect": {
    "ready": true,
    "readinessNotified": true,
    "detecting": true,
    "settling": false
   }
  },
  {
